      <ExplanationTxt>The organization is located on a US Air Forceaffiliated military installation inOkinawa Japan All board members officers and workers are required to maintain Statusof Forces Agreement SOFA status Due to military orders governing board members andofficers frequently rotate off the installation often near or at the end of the fiscalyearDuring the tax year in question multiple leadership transitions occurred as aresult of required military reassignment which delayed completion of the Form 990 Thelate filing was not due to willful neglect but to circumstances beyond the organizationscontrol Once new leadership was established the organization acted promptly and in goodfaith to complete and file the return to the best of its abilityAccordingly the organization respectfully requests abatement of any penalties and accruedinterest under the reasonable cause provisions of the Internal Revenue Code</ExplanationTxt>
